{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116893","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116893/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116893/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116893/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116893","id":4004765655,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7us9_X","number":116893,"title":"Performance: Godot Android Configuration Plugin burns CPU","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-28T14:39:53Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T10:58:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThe Godot Android configuration changes from 14e6696c8e3f79db64c37eff8bcdebfa2f99bc57 introduced a constant polling on every frame for changes to the export configuration of Android, and this shows up when Godot is idling and is a major source of battery drain - for a longer discussion see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845\n\nWhat this does is to call  EditorExport::update_export_presets on every single frame being rendered.   Ideally, we should have these plugins raise an even that the EditorNode can respond to, or post a notification about a configuration change taking place, rather than having this busy looping happening.\n\nI am opening this bug, so we can have a focused discussion on what needs to be solved here.  \n\n\n\n### System information\n\nAny system\n\n### Issue description\n\nMajor battery drain in the editor when idling.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen any Godot project, let it sit without doing anything, attach a profiler, watch it burn battery.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny project will do.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116893/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116893/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}